integrationSettings.promptTemplate:
Use only the Duke website facts and fit rows below. Explain why Duke is a good choice for Harrison, a high-school founder building Cell AI Data. Focus on engineering, data/AI, research, entrepreneurship, business thinking, campus community, and realistic cautions. Do not overclaim admissions outcomes. Return email-ready output plus a short SMS.

Duke fit data:
{{previous_step}}

integrationSettings.returnFormat:
{
  "summary": "short personal recommendation",
  "best_reasons": [
    {
      "reason": "reason title",
      "why_it_matters": "short explanation"
    }
  ],
  "cautions": ["short caution"],
  "email": {
    "subject": "Duke University fit analysis",
    "body": "clear email analysis"
  },
  "sms": "short text under 300 characters"
}

integrationSettings.transformMapping:
summary <- {{summary}}
email_subject <- {{email.subject}}
email_body <- {{email.body}}
sms <- {{sms}}
reason_1 <- {{best_reasons.0.reason}}
reason_2 <- {{best_reasons.1.reason}}
caution_1 <- {{cautions.0}}
